iana-etc

/etc/services and /etc/protocols are generated by iana-etc
(https://github.com/Mic92/iana-etc) from the Internet Assigned Numbers Authority's
"Service Name and Transport Protocol Port Number Registry" and "Protocol Numbers"
registry (https://www.iana.org/protocols).

Neither the iana-etc release tarball nor the registries carry a license text of their
own. IANA publishes the registries for anyone to use; this image records that as
LicenseRef-IANA in its SBOM, and this notice stands in for the license file the other
components ship here.
